5. Très important : transition du viewer

Utilisez cette version :

.viewer {

    background: #17202d;

    min-width: 0;

    min-height: 0;

    display: flex;

    flex-direction: column;

    overflow: hidden;

    opacity: 0;

    visibility: hidden;

    transform: translateX(30px);

    pointer-events: none;

    transition:
        opacity .3s ease,
        transform .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1),
        visibility 0s linear .4s;
}


.viewer.open {

    opacity: 1;

    visibility: visible;

    transform: translateX(0);

    pointer-events: auto;

    transition:
        opacity .3s ease,
        transform .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1),
        visibility 0s linear 0s;
}


